  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An electron is moving along the positive x-axis. If uniform magnetic field is applied parallel to the negative z-axis, then</p><p>A.The electron will experience magnetic force along positive y-axis</p><p>B.The electron will experience magnetic force along negative y-axis</p><p>C.The electron will not experience any force in magnetic field</p><p>D.The electron will continue to move along the positive x-axis</p><p>E.The electron will move along circular path in magnetic field</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the option given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZUFy6",
      "text": "<p>A and E only</p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1t9iA",
      "text": "<p>C and D only</p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Cx1oq",
      "text": "<p>B and E only</p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b3NpK",
      "text": "<p>B and D only</p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The Lorentz force is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#160;along&#160;</mtext><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext>&#160;axis&#160;</mtext></math></p><p>As the magnetic field is perpendicular to the velocity, motion would be circular.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
